  <h2>Friday Evening: Erev Shabbat Service and Oneg</h2>
    <p><strong>When:</strong> 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM, December 4th, 2026</p>
    <p><strong>Location:</strong> Temple Israel (<a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=3100+E+Broad+St+Columbus+OH+43209" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get Directions</a>)</p>
    <p><strong>Address:</strong> 3100 E Broad St, Columbus, OH 43209</p>
    <p>Join us Friday evening as we welcome Shabbat with a special synagogue service, followed by an Oneg reception where family and friends can mingle over light refreshments, desserts, and beverages.</p>
